            "scene_title": "Introducing IoT in Everyday Devices",
            "setting": "Mia's kitchen with her smart fridge.",
            "scene_image_path": "/static/images/scene_3.png",
            "dialogues_with_audio": [
                {
                    "character": "Dr. Lee",
                    "line": "Yes, IoT allows everyday devices to connect and communicate. For example, your smart fridge can call you when you're out of milk.",
